# Production: set BACKEND_API_URL di Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables.
# Isinya URL origin backend yang sudah aktif tanpa /api. Jangan gunakan URL contoh.
# URL origin backend yang diproxy oleh Vercel Function.
# Set BACKEND_API_URL di Vercel Project Settings, contoh: https://study-planner-api.up.railway.app
# Alamat Express saat `npm run dev` (proxy Vite).
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:3001
